<section class="home-section home-security-section surface-light" aria-labelledby="security-title"><div class="container-wide home-security-layout"><div class="security-visual" data-home-reveal><div class="security-visual-ring ring-one"></div><div class="security-visual-ring ring-two"></div><div class="security-shield"><?= ui_icon('shield') ?><span>FOUNDATION</span></div><div class="security-orbit-label orbit-cookie">STRICT COOKIE DEFAULTS</div><div class="security-orbit-label orbit-path">PROTECTED PATHS</div><div class="security-orbit-label orbit-csrf">CSRF HELPERS</div></div><div class="security-copy" data-home-reveal><span class="home-kicker">FOUNDATIONS WITH CARE</span><h2 id="security-title">Security is built<br><em>into the foundation.</em></h2><p>The project includes careful session cookie defaults, CSRF helpers and guarded private storage paths. These are foundations for future workflows, not a claim of completed account security certification.</p><ul><li><span><?= ui_icon('check') ?></span><div><strong>Protected session defaults</strong><small>Strict session mode, HttpOnly and SameSite cookie settings are prepared.</small></div></li><li><span><?= ui_icon('check') ?></span><div><strong>Private document foundation</strong><small>Private upload paths are separated from public media directories.</small></div></li><li><span><?= ui_icon('check') ?></span><div><strong>Validation ready</strong><small>Future forms must validate data server-side before it is stored.</small></div></li></ul><a class="home-text-link" href="<?= e(site_url('security')) ?>">Learn about security foundations <?= ui_icon('arrow-right') ?></a></div></div></section>
